\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打开（门等）；拆开（包裹等）；解锁；开门营业；开业；清空；腾出；留出空间；搬出；清空；离开（家等）；暂时外出；破晓；天亮；结束；终了；（新年）开始；新年伊始；空出（时间）；腾出时间；打（洞）；开（洞）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201846\">ドアはジムによって<ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けられます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">门是吉姆打开的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">上げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抬起；提高；移到高处；放到（如架子）上；提高（价格、质量、地位等）；涨（工资）；领（某人）进房间；迎入（如客人）；给予；赠与；送（孩子）入学；送去（如上大学）；培养（才能、技能等）；提高；磨练；获得（好的结果）；取得（如好成绩）；得到；提拔（某人）；晋升；完成；做完；发出（大的声音）；提高（嗓音）；抬起（视线）；抬起（脸）；向上看；盘（头发）；梳起（头发）；向神佛供奉（香、祈祷等）；表扬；称赞；奉承；控制在预算内；用给定金额支付开销；控制费用；修完（课业）；上完（课程）；通过（如课程）；上传（如图片）；在网上发布；发帖；提振某人的情绪；使某人振奋；烘托气氛；（潮水）涨潮；上涨；（市价）上涨；（股价）上升；呕吐；吐；为（别人的利益）做；做完…；完成…；谦恭地做…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170915\"><ruby>左手<rp>(</rp><rt>ひだりて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">举起左手</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">挙げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">列举；例举；显示；展示；引用；鼓起；汇聚；聚集；逮捕；捉拿；抓获；拘捕；提名；推荐；提议；建议；举办；举行；进行；主持；起义；举兵；武装反抗；公布；宣扬；传播；成名；生育；生养；抚养；养育；抬起；举起；提高；升高；发出；提高；扬起（嗓音）；赢得；获得；取得；达到</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149532\"><ruby>質問<rp>(</rp><rt>しつもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があれば<ruby>右手<rp>(</rp><rt>みぎて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>挙<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果有问题，请举起你的右手。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/344199\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">揚げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">油炸；炸（食物）；燃放（烟火等）；升起（旗等）；放（风筝）；放飞；召唤；传唤（艺妓等）；靠岸；上岸；移上陆地；吸收；吸取（水等）；汲取</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112044\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたこを<ruby>揚<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他飞风筝。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">憧れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あこがれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">憧憬；向往；渴望；敬仰；钦佩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">憧れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あこがれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">憧憬；向往；渴望；仰慕；敬仰</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230690\">あの<ruby>人達<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>都会<rp>(</rp><rt>とかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>生活<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあこがれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们渴望城市生活。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">顎</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">下颌；下巴；鱼钩倒刺</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146366\"><ruby>笑<rp>(</rp><rt>わら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いすぎて、<ruby>顎<rp>(</rp><rt>あご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がはずれそうになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我笑得那么厉害 下巴差点脱落</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">朝</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">早晨；上午；早餐；早饭</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126237\"><ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のラッシュは<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がピークだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">早上的赶时间已经到了顶峰</span></div></li>"]